      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It would be a good idea to go to Tel Village and \r\nconsult with Alfred. \r\nI remember there was a path that leads \r\nfrom the village to the forest.",
        "Jp" : "テル村へ行ってアルフレドに相談するといい\r\n確か、村から森の方へ抜けられる道が\r\nあったはずだ"
