      "En" : "Donnell",
      "Jp" : "ドネル"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 7536,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When will the bridge be repaired?",
        "Jp" : "橋はいつ直るのかって？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20048,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I don't know—\r\nWell, I suppose it would be good to have lumber \r\nfrom the Mysree Forest. \r\nBut it's quite difficult to \r\ntransport it all the way here.",
        "Jp" : "さあな――ミスリウの森の材木があれば\r\n良いのだろうが――\r\nここまで木を運ぶのはかなり大変だ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20049,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The area around the Pawn Cathedral will probably \r\nhave to be reached through Tel Village for a while.",
        "Jp" : "《ポーン郷》方面はしばらくのあいだ\r\nテル村経由で行くしかないだろうな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20050,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1312,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Donnell",
      "Jp" : "ドネル"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 7537,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 15,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, it's you...\r\nYou had some troubles the other day.",
        "Jp" : "おお、貴君は――\r\nいつぞやはご苦労だったな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20053,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 16,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let's have a proper introduction.\r\nI am the Area Master of the Hidell Plains,\r\nAlfred the Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "あらためて挨拶をさせてもらおう\r\nわたしはハイデル平原のエリアマスター\r\n覚者のアルフレドだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20054,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I think you already know, but an Area Master is \r\nthe supervisor who oversees a designated area.",
        "Jp" : "知っていると思うがエリアマスターとは\r\n担当地区を取り仕切る監督官のことだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20055,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now then— \r\nAs Area Masters, we provide information and \r\nsupply items to the Arisen who visit our areas.",
        "Jp" : "さて――\r\n我々エリアマスターは、エリアを訪れる覚者に対し\r\n情報の提供や、アイテムの支給を行っている"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 20056,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 19,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Furthermore, for individuals with high area fame,\r\nin other words, a high \"Area Rank\",\r\naccess permits to sealed areas \r\ncan also be granted.",
        "Jp" : "また、エリアの名声度\r\n――つまり、《エリアランク》が高い者に対しては\r\n封鎖された場所への立入許可を\r\n与えることもできるのだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 278565,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Are you looking to go to the Pawn Cathedral?\r\nPerfect timing if that's the case.",
        "Jp" : "貴君は今、《ポーン郷》へ行きたいのだろう？\r\nならば、丁度良い"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 92909,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The achievements you made when you came here\r\nas Leo's envoy are highly commendable.",
        "Jp" : "以前レオの使者として貴君がここに来た時の\r\n活躍は十分評価に値する"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 92910,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As a token of gratitude,\r\nhow about we open up one of the sealed areas?",
        "Jp" : "その礼として、封鎖エリアの一つを\r\n開放しようではないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 92911,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I will ensure that you can pass through\r\nthe Hunters' Secret Passage that leads to\r\nthe Pawn Cathedral. The path may prove dangerous,\r\nbut I'm sure you will be able to handle it.",
        "Jp" : "《ポーン郷》へと続く《狩人の抜け穴》を\r\n貴君が通れるようにしておこう\r\nやや危険だが、貴君なら問題ないだろう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 235195,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 24,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Then, please speak to me again and choose \r\n\"Area Information.\" \r\nConfirm the Area Rank and its contents for me.",
        "Jp" : "では、わたしに話しかけ直して\r\n《エリア情報》を選び\r\nエリアランクとその内容を確認してくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 235196,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1313,
    "NpcName" : {
